  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Towards greater inclusion: age and gender tailored assistance and protection services for older women violence survivors or at risk</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improve evidence, protection and assistance of older women in Moldova from age and gender based violence and abuse including during and post Covid-19 context in Moldova.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Outcome 1: Improved prevention of intimate partner violence and non-partner violence against older women through changes in knowledge, attitudes and practices amongst individuals and communities across
Moldova by September 2025.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Outcome 2: Increased effectiveness of CSOs and volunteer initiative groups to support older women survivors and those at risk in South Moldova by September 2025</narrative>
  </description>
